# AN INDIVIDUAL ASSERTED INTO owl:Nothing (SPEC 5.3 L8). ⊥ ∈ S(individual(a))
# is exactly the inconsistency condition.
# Expect: INCONSISTENT (exit 1).

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual , owl:Nothing .
